Error case: an empty --type key is a usage error (exit code 2) before any request.
-- args --
activities
privacy
set
private
--type
running,,cycling
--force
-- table stdout --
-- table stderr --
Usage: gccli activities privacy set <level> [flags]

Change the privacy of all past activities, or of past activities of some types.

Garmin applies the change within minutes. activities privacy status shows the
progress. To change one activity, use activity privacy.

Arguments:
  <level>    Who can see the activities: public, private or connections.

Flags:
  -h, --help              Show context-sensitive help.
  -j, --json              Output as JSON ($GCCLI_JSON).
      --plain             Output as plain text (TSV) ($GCCLI_PLAIN).
      --header            Print the column names as the first line of --plain
                          output ($GCCLI_HEADER).
      --color="auto"      Color mode: auto, always, never ($GCCLI_COLOR).
      --account=STRING    Garmin account email ($GCCLI_ACCOUNT).
      --units="auto"      Unit system for distances, speeds, paces,
                          elevations and weights in table and plain output:
                          auto (Garmin profile), metric, statute_us, statute_uk
                          ($GCCLI_UNITS).
      --version           Print version information.

      --type=KEY,...      Top-level activity type key (e.g. running, cycling).
                          Repeat the flag or separate with commas. Default:
                          all activity types.
  -f, --force             Skip confirmation prompt.

